## 2. Quick Start — Running the Website & Verification Suites

> **Windows Users:** See the dedicated [README_WINDOWS.md](README_WINDOWS.md) or simply double-click `start_server_windows.bat`.

### 1. Start the Local Scientific Web Server

The backend server has **zero third-party dependencies** (Python standard library only).

**On Windows (Command Prompt / PowerShell):**
```cmd
python 08_WEBSITE\backend\server.py --port 8080
```
*(Or use `py 08_WEBSITE\backend\server.py --port 8080`, or double-click `start_server_windows.bat`)*

**On macOS / Linux:**
```bash
python3 08_WEBSITE/backend/server.py --port 8080
```

Then open `http://127.0.0.1:8080/` (or `http://localhost:8080/`) in your browser. The server provides HTTP/1.1 with `206 Partial Content` byte-range streaming for the NASA SVS 5011 MP4 visualization (`iss_lightning_sphere_07312023.mp4`) and serves all validated production JSON/GeoJSON payloads from `06_PROCESSED_DATA/`.

### 2. Dependencies Summary

- **Web Application & Audio Engine:** Python 3.8+ (Standard library only; **0 pip packages needed**). Audio synthesizes in real time via the browser's Web Audio API.
- **Optional Scientific Environment (Raw Data Processing):** `pip install -r requirements.txt` (installs `numpy`, `scipy`, `pandas`, `xarray`, `netCDF4`, `h5py`, `shapely`, `pyproj`, `geojson` for processing raw NASA `.nc` and `.hdf` files).
- **Optional Test Suites (Playwright & ESM Unit Tests):** Node.js 18+; run `npm install` and `npx playwright install chromium`.

### 3. Run the Automated Verification Suites
```bash
# 1. Verify workspace & raw NASA file integrity (10 / 10 checks)
python3 scripts/verify_workspace.py          # Windows: python scripts\verify_workspace.py

# 2. Verify backend HTTP server, /api/health, MIME headers & HTTP 206 byte-range video (6 / 6 checks)
python3 08_WEBSITE/backend/server.py --self-test

# 3. Verify Task 4 production JSON/GeoJSON mathematical reconciliation (11 / 11 gates)
python3 04_DATA_PROCESSING/scripts/validate_production_data.py

# 4. Verify Task 3 independent NetCDF-4 reproducibility across all 6 anchor records
python3 scripts/verify_task3_reproducibility.py

# 5. Run Task 5 Unit & Real Data Integration Suite (9 / 9 suites)
node scripts/test_task5_unit_and_integration.mjs

# 6. Run Task 5 Playwright E2E & Accessibility Smoke Test Suite (13 / 13 checks)
node scripts/verify_task5_playwright_e2e.mjs
```

