## 3. Workspace Folder Structure

```text
sonifyerth/
├── 01_NASA_RAW_DATA/                     # Untouched primary raw NASA datasets (428 files verified)
│   ├── science_v2/                       # 106 .nc and 106 .hdf ISS LIS Science V2.2 files
│   ├── backgrounds_v2/                   # 106 .nc and 106 .hdf ISS LIS Backgrounds V2.2 files
│   └── original_downloads/               # Byte-for-byte archived download folders and PDFs
├── 02_NASA_DOCUMENTATION/                # Official NASA reference guides & Master Specification
│   ├── SONIFYEARTH_MASTER_PROJECT_SPECIFICATION.md
│   ├── science_v2_guide.pdf
│   ├── backgrounds_v2_guide.pdf
│   ├── lis_algorithm.pdf
│   └── lis_anomalies.pdf
├── 03_DATA_INSPECTION/                   # Task 2 NetCDF-4 variable dictionaries & schema reports
├── 04_DATA_PROCESSING/                   # Task 4 reproducible extraction & validation scripts
├── 05_SCIENTIFIC_VALIDATION/             # Task 3 granule matching, TAI93 & 3-state verification
├── 06_PROCESSED_DATA/                    # Validated website-ready JSON & GeoJSON payloads
│   ├── json/                             # source_manifest, flash_events, observation_windows, three_state_data, sonifyearth_windows, excluded_records_audit, schema
│   └── geojson/                          # lightning_events, observation_grid, unknown_coverage
├── 07_PROJECT_REPORTS/                   # Research, architecture, design system & validation reports
├── 08_WEBSITE/                           # Complete SonifyEarth scientific web application
│   ├── backend/server.py                 # HTTP 1.1 server with 206 Partial Content Range support
│   ├── frontend/                         # index.html, css/styles.css, js/ (app, map, timeline, inspector, adapter)
│   └── public/favicon.svg                # Accessible brand icon
├── 09_SOUND_ENGINE/                      # Deterministic Web Audio API synthesis engine
│   ├── audio_mapping/sound_cue_spec.js   # Locked 3-cue parameters & prohibited mapping guardrails
│   └── playback/sound_engine.js          # Web Audio API synthesizer & orphan-free node lifecycle
├── 10_DEVELOPER_HANDOFF/                 # API contracts & production JSON/GeoJSON schemas
├── scripts/                              # Workspace, data, unit, and Playwright E2E test runners
├── iss_lightning_sphere_07312023.mp4     # Official NASA SVS 5011 visualization video (127 MB)
├── Screenshot 2026-11-09 at 08.26.06.png # NASA SVS 5011 preview frame
├── start_server_windows.bat              # Windows Command Prompt one-click server launcher
├── start_server_windows.ps1              # Windows PowerShell server launcher
└── README_WINDOWS.md                     # Dedicated Windows 10/11 setup & startup instructions
```

